}
\par\pard\plain
\slmult0\ltrpar\li200
{\fs24
A. Gi\u7899\'3fi thi\u7879\'3fu chung
}
\par\pard\plain
\slmult0\ltrpar\li400
{\fs20
I. Gi\u7899\'3fi thi\u7879\'3fu c\u244\'3fng vi\u7879\'3fc
}
\par\pard\plain
{\slmult0\ltrpar\li400
Tham gia ph\u225\'3ft tri\u7875\'3fn d\u7921\'3f \u225\'3fn, ph\u225\'3ft tri\u7875\'3fn ph\u7847\'3fn m\u7873\'3fm v\u224\'3f s\u7917\'3fa l\u7895\'3fi trong 2 th\u225\'3fng th\u7921\'3fc t\u7853\'3fp.
\par\pard\plain}
\slmult0\ltrpar\li400
{\fs20
II. Gi\u7899\'3fi thi\u7879\'3fu b\u224\'3fi to\u225\'3fn
}
\par\pard\plain
{\slmult0\ltrpar\li400
H\u7885\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fng Anh qua game gi\u250\'3fp h\u7885\'3fc sinh nh\u7899\'3f b\u224\'3fi l\u226\'3fu h\u417\'3fn, t\u259\'3fng t\u432\'3f\u417\'3fng t\u225\'3fc l\u7899\'3fp h\u7885\'3fc.
\par\pard\plain}
\slmult0\ltrpar\li200
{\fs24
C. C\u225\'3fc l\u253\'3f thuy\u7871\'3ft, gi\u7843\'3fi ph\u225\'3fp, thu\u7853\'3ft to\u225\'3fn li\u234\'3fn quan
}
\par\pard\plain
\slmult0\ltrpar\li400
{\fs20
I. M\u244\'3f h\u236\'3fnh client-server
}
\par\pard\plain
{\slmult0\ltrpar\li400
M\u225\'3fy kh\u225\'3fch g\u7917\'3fi y\u234\'3fu c\u7847\'3fu, m\u225\'3fy ch\u7911\'3f x\u7917\'3f l\u253\'3f v\u224\'3f tr\u7843\'3f k\u7871\'3ft qu\u7843\'3f; t\u7853\'3fp trung \u7913\'3fng d\u7909\'3fng v\u224\'3f t\u224\'3fi nguy\u234\'3fn.
\par\pard\plain}
\slmult0\ltrpar\li400
{\fs20
II. Giao th\u7913\'3fc HTTP, HTTP Request v\u224\'3f HTTP Response
}
\par\pard\plain
\slmult0\ltrpar\li600
{\fs20
1. Giao th\u7913\'3fc HTTP
}
\par\pard\plain
{\slmult0\ltrpar\li600
Giao th\u7913\'3fc truy\u7873\'3fn t\u7843\'3fi si\u234\'3fu v\u259\'3fn b\u7843\'3fn, d\u249\'3fng trong m\u244\'3f h\u236\'3fnh Client/Server, c\u225\'3fc ph\u432\'3f\u417\'3fng th\u7913\'3fc: GET, POST, PUT, DELETE.
\par\pard\plain}
\slmult0\ltrpar\li600
{\fs20
2. HTTP Request
}
\par\pard\plain
{\slmult0\ltrpar\li600
Client m\u7903\'3f k\u7871\'3ft n\u7889\'3fi TCP, g\u7917\'3fi request v\u7899\'3fi header ch\u7913\'3fa th\u244\'3fng tin nh\u432\'3f Accept, Cookie, User-Agent.
\par\pard\plain}
\slmult0\ltrpar\li600
{\fs20
3. HTTP Response
}
\par\pard\plain
{\slmult0\ltrpar\li600
Server tr\u7843\'3f v\u7873\'3f response v\u7899\'3fi status code x\u225\'3fc \u273\'3f\u7883\'3fnh tr\u7841\'3fng th\u225\'3fi request.
\par\pard\plain}
\slmult0\ltrpar\li400
{\fs20
III. Giao di\u7879\'3fn l\u7853\'3fp tr\u236\'3fnh \u7913\'3fng d\u7909\'3fng, ti\u234\'3fu chu\u7849\'3fn RESTful API v\u224\'3f JSON
}
\par\pard\plain
\slmult0\ltrpar\li600
{\fs20
1. Giao di\u7879\'3fn l\u7853\'3fp tr\u236\'3fnh \u7913\'3fng d\u7909\'3fng (API)
}
\par\pard\plain
{\slmult0\ltrpar\li600
Ph\u432\'3f\u417\'3fng th\u7913\'3fc k\u7871\'3ft n\u7889\'3fi v\u224\'3f trao \u273\'3f\u7893\'3fi d\u7919\'3f li\u7879\'3fu gi\u7919\'3fa c\u225\'3fc \u7913\'3fng d\u7909\'3fng, th\u432\'3f\u7901\'3fng tr\u7843\'3f d\u7919\'3f li\u7879\'3fu JSON ho\u7863\'3fc XML.
\par\pard\plain}
\slmult0\ltrpar\li600
{\fs20
2. Ti\u234\'3fu chu\u7849\'3fn RESTful API
}
\par\pard\plain
{\slmult0\ltrpar\li600
Thi\u7871\'3ft k\u7871\'3f API qu\u7843\'3fn l\u253\'3f t\u224\'3fi nguy\u234\'3fn qua HTTP method, kh\u244\'3fng gi\u7899\'3fi h\u7841\'3fn ng\u244\'3fn ng\u7919\'3f l\u7853\'3fp tr\u236\'3fnh.
\par\pard\plain}
\slmult0\ltrpar\li600
{\fs20
3. JSON
}
\par\pard\plain
{\slmult0\ltrpar\li600
\u272\'3f\u7883\'3fnh d\u7841\'3fng d\u7919\'3f li\u7879\'3fu m\u7903\'3f, ph\u7893\'3f bi\u7871\'3fn \u273\'3f\u7875\'3f trao \u273\'3f\u7893\'3fi d\u7919\'3f li\u7879\'3fu tr\u234\'3fn web.
\par\pard\plain}
\slmult0\ltrpar\li600
{\fs20
4. Framework ReactJs, Nodejs
}
\par\pard\plain
{\slmult0\ltrpar\li600
ReactJS d\u249\'3fng x\u226\'3fy d\u7921\'3fng giao di\u7879\'3fn ng\u432\'3f\u7901\'3fi d\u249\'3fng; NodeJS n\u7873\'3fn t\u7843\'3fng ch\u7841\'3fy JavaScript ph\u237\'3fa server.
\par\pard\plain}
\slmult0\ltrpar\li600
{\fs20
