}
\par\pard\plain
{\slmult0\ltrpar\li400
Ph\u432\'3f\u417\'3fng ph\u225\'3fp ph\u225\'3ft tri\u7875\'3fn linh ho\u7841\'3ft, nh\u7845\'3fn m\u7841\'3fnh c\u225\'3f nh\u226\'3fn, ph\u7847\'3fn m\u7873\'3fm ch\u7841\'3fy \u273\'3f\u432\'3f\u7907\'3fc, h\u7907\'3fp t\u225\'3fc kh\u225\'3fch h\u224\'3fng, \u273\'3f\u225\'3fp \u7913\'3fng thay \u273\'3f\u7893\'3fi.
